      "description": "Snoop Dogg is a real-world cultural icon known for his association with cannabis, hip-hop music, and his distinctive style. His presence in the meme is not just visual but symbolic, representing the 'weed' culture. This requires knowledge of his public persona and cultural significance to understand the meme's intent.",
