      "description": "The meme perpetuates a harmful stereotype by associating Black people with cannabis use, which can reinforce negative and reductive racial tropes. The humor derived from this juxtaposition may trivialize serious issues around drug use and racial stereotypes, making it potentially harmful to the Black community.",
